# Line endings follow .editorconfig on every clone, whatever core.autocrlf is set to: CRLF, and LF for shell
# scripts and YAML. The repository stores LF either way. Without this, dotnet format's line-ending check passed
# only on a clone made with core.autocrlf=true (#2806).
* text=auto eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Images are binary: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
